# Powerunits first-safe (Repo A)

- This repo is Hermes **runtime**, not product DB/schema truth (that is Repo B).
- Read-first; no infra mutation (Railway/DNS/secrets) via commits; never commit `.env`.
- Timescale / Repo B tools are env-gated allowlists only — not general DB or free-path browse.
- Preserve prompt-cache invariants (no mid-conversation toolset/prompt rebuilds).
- Full guide: `docs/agent_context/hermes_development_guide.md`. Map: `docs/agent_context/repo_map.md`.
